# Scientific Evidence

Evidence Level

★★★★☆

Explosive unilateral resistance training improves lower-body power, rate of force development and neuromuscular coordination. While direct evidence on cable-resisted kicking is limited, biomechanical principles strongly support its transfer to kicking performance.

