# Final Principle

A powerful front kick begins at the ground.

The supporting leg creates force,

the hips accelerate it,

the trunk transfers it,

and the striking leg delivers it with precision.

The Cable Front Kick develops this complete kinetic chain,

transforming lower-body strength into explosive combat performance.